        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In 2025, we managed approximately 2 billion customer service interactions, captured and classified over 14 billion documents and claims, and supported millions of employees with human resource (\"HR\") services.",
        "start_character": 2392,
        "end_character": 2601
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We market and sell our solutions and services to both potential and existing clients through our global sales and business development teams.",
        "start_character": 29620,
        "end_character": 29761
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate in markets with compelling growth opportunities, including Business Process as a Service, transportation, payments and customer experience management, as well as in many industries, including healthcare and financial services.",
        "start_character": 11141,
        "end_character": 11378
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We serve a substantial portion of the public sector, providing market-leading government and transportation offerings that streamline enrollment and automate claims for government-funded programs such as Medicaid, accurately deliver benefits payments that residents depend on every day, and seamlessly move travelers.",
        "start_character": 2602,
        "end_character": 2919
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Delivery Optimization: We continue to operate more efficiently through common processes with a shared services model that enables economies of scale and creates greater accountability for client performance.",
        "start_character": 8115,
        "end_character": 8323
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Improve End-User Experience: We are enhancing both user interfaces and experiences across our offerings by expanding self-service tools, AI-powered capabilities and mobile apps and by leveraging deeper user insights through analytics.",
        "start_character": 9623,
        "end_character": 9858
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Integrated Digital Solutions: We provide high volume print and mail services, enrollment processing and personalized communications to large corporations and are a leading provider in this market with more than 14 billion documents captured, indexed and classified annually.",
        "start_character": 26077,
        "end_character": 26352
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001677703-26-000024",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001677703-26-000024-872c62d0d5437419",
        "accession_number": "0001677703-26-000024",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We also offer a broad set of child support services predominately to State Disbursement Units, including processing and distributing payments, child support payment cards, childcare credentialing and case management, among others, to help states comply with federal standards.",
