        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•We deliver a full range of customer contact services, including customer care, technical support, loyalty management, and outbound and inbound sales, handling many complex interactions and representing the brands of our clients.",
